@igrigorik @mikewest @raymeskhoury @ojanvafai @clelland

It would be good if the spec here for `allowpaymentrequest` could be described in terms of Feature Policy. Can you review this and make sure Feature Policy has the exact same behavior (or propose changes for this PR so they are the same)? Also see comments in #2184.

I would be happy to add any hooks to HTML that FP can use if necessary.
